    "interpretation": "The temporal arm trains only on earlier cultures and is tested on the most recent ones, with patients who straddle the cut-off removed from the test side. It is the deployment-realistic number: resistance prevalence and prescribing both drift, so a model fitted on the past faces a shifted distribution. A drop here relative to the patient-grouped split is expected and is reported rather than hidden."
